     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi all,<div><br></div><div>I have built an Shiny app on my VPS and I can see my app from <a href=\"http://my_site.com:3838\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://my_site.com:3838&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792407149039000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2WD650C_ydMOg8WHjniw6R\">http://my_site.com:3838</a></div><div><br></div><div>If I want to see the app from  <a href=\"http://my_site.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://my_site.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792407149039000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0Vcf6MCvwAGk9Ld6N-5GOo\">http://my_site.com</a> , How should I redirect the URL?</div>\r\n<div><br></div><div>I read the Shiny Server Configuration Reference, and using the redirect{} in a wrong way.</div><div><br></div><div>Could anybody help my to fix the problem?</div><div><br></div><div>-------------------------</div>\r\n<div>Here is my Shiny-server.conf</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><div>run_as shiny;</div><div><br></div><div>server {</div><div>  listen 3838;</div><div><br></div><div>  location / {</div>\r\n<div>    site_dir /var/www/html/my_site/public_html;</div><div>    log_dir /var/log/shiny-server;</div><div>    directory_index on;</div><div>  }</div><div><br></div><div>redirect &quot;<a href=\"http://my_site.net\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://my_site.net&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792407149039000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1nXf01q4j4vfvY-3nozI0q\">my_site.net</a>&quot;;  &lt;====That&#39;s wrong</div>\r\n<div><br></div><div>}</div><div><br></div><div>-----------------------------</div><div>Here is my vhost.conf </div><div><br></div><div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>NameVirtualHost bbb.bbb.bbb.bbb:80</div>\r\n<div>&lt;VirtualHost bbb.bbb.bbb.bbb:80&gt;</div><div>     DocumentRoot /var/www/html/forbidden</div><div>     ServerName bbb.bbb.bbb.bbb</div><div>&lt;/VirtualHost&gt;</div><div><br></div><div>&lt;VirtualHost bbb.bbb.bbb.bbb:80&gt;</div>\r\n<div>     ServerAdmin <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">webmaster@my_site.net</a></div><div>     ServerName <a href=\"http://my_site.net\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://my_site.net&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792407149039000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1nXf01q4j4vfvY-3nozI0q\">my_site.net</a></div><div>     ServerAlias <a href=\"http://www.my_site.net\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.my_site.net&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792407149039000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3-qUZFip52VwmlWiOusS5V\">www.my_site.net</a></div>\r\n<div>     DocumentRoot /var/www/html/<a href=\"http://my_site.net/public_html/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://my_site.net/public_html/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792407149039000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3B5PJQzD6hMnHq5BZ_Waie\">my_site.net/public_html/</a></div><div>     ErrorLog /var/www/html/<a href=\"http://lmy_site.net/logs/error.log\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://lmy_site.net/logs/error.log&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792407149039000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0jneszjXwAeAfxR6TsKkVZ\">lmy_site.net/logs/error.log</a></div>\r\n<div>     CustomLog /var/www/html/<a href=\"http://my_site.net/logs/access.log\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://my_site.net/logs/access.log&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792407149039000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3uLQUnJ1VoNlYcjFZZdaWR\">my_site.net/logs/access.log</a> combined</div><div>&lt;/VirtualHost&gt;</div><div><br></div></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div>\r\n<div><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:14.44444465637207px\">Regards,</span></div><div><span style=\"font-famil